Package: gnome-wifi-hotspot
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Erhan Zeyrek <erhanzeyrek@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash, util-linux, sysvinit-utils, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, network-manager, hostapd, dnsmasq-base, iw, iproute2, iptables, polkitd, dbus
Suggests: gnome-wifi-hotspot-gnome (= @VERSION@), gnome-wifi-hotspot-tray (= @VERSION@)
Homepage: https://github.com/3togo/gnome-wifi-hotspot
Description: Wi-Fi Relay service and standalone hotspot settings
 Share a Wi-Fi connection through a virtual access point. Includes a GTK4
 settings application and a system D-Bus daemon with a shared NetworkManager
 client. Desktop controls are available in separate optional packages.
 Concurrent operation requires compatible wireless hardware and drivers.
